      <activity id="d24bdaa1-7cbc-5d7d-88b0-54aab79fcf99" activityNameId="aff5a586-aab1-5b22-8492-5e74ae905a92" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, gold-silver-zinc-lead-copper</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, gold-silver-zinc-lead-copper
This data set includes land use of the Swedish considered mines incl. revegetated areas as well as generic estimates of buildings and machinery of the mine based on the data set non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground.;
UUID: 08c62db8-18d4-316e-9d7d-52e806db7720
Land use, buildings and machinery of a combined metal mine
Location: Land use for Sweden, other inputs based on rough assumptions.
Technology: Assumptions for buildings and machinery based on the data set "non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground with 50 years life time.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: &gt;2.32E7 t ore
Sampling: environmental report for landuse only 
Extrapolations: Buildings and machinery are based on global assumptions. The figures were extrapolated on the basis of the ore production (2.32E10 kg per year)
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08c62db8-18d4-316e-9d7d-52e806db7720.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
